   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELT402 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.2</span>\n<h2>Grading: every mark and its weight</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Read this in week one — part of the grade is earned in class long before any exam.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13471 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELT402 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.2</span>\n<h2>Cách tính điểm: đủ mọi đầu điểm và trọng số</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đọc ngay tuần đầu — một phần điểm được tính trong lớp từ rất sớm, trước mọi kỳ thi.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13471 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Category<br><small>Đầu điểm</small></th><th>Type<br><small>Loại</small></th><th>Parts<br><small>Số phần</small></th><th>Weight<br><small>Trọng số</small></th><th>Completion criteria<br><small>Điều kiện hoàn thành</small></th><th>Duration<br><small>Thời lượng</small></th><th>CLO</th><th>Question type<br><small>Dạng câu hỏi</small></th><th>No. of questions<br><small>Số câu</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Project 1 - Human-generated translation</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>20.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>flexible</td><td>LO1-LO5</td><td>Students translate 01 English-Vietnamese text and 01 Vietnamese-English text of administrative, business, financial, technical, socio-cultural issues. The text length is 250 words</td><td>2</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Project 2 - AI-generated translation editing</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>20.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>flexible</td><td>All LOs</td><td>Groups are assigned with 02 texts (SL: Vietnamese &amp; English) translated by AI/ CAT tools. The topic revolves administration, business, finance, technology and engineering, and socio-culture.They then fully post-edit the AI/CAT-translated text for a target audience, paying attention to the register, style, terminology and context.Finally, they make a declaration of AI/ CAT use (how, where, and why)</td><td>2</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Project 3 - Integrated project</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>20.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>flexible</td><td>All LOs</td><td>(Students are assigned a translation project, either an authentic project or a simulation one, using AI/ CAT toolsGroups of 3-4 with different roles in a project: project manager, AI-human collaborative translators/ editors, chief editor)</td><td>N/A</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Translation</strong></td><td>Final exam</td><td>1</td><td><strong>40.0%</strong></td><td>4</td><td>90'</td><td>All LOs</td><td>Translate texts given on the topics covered from Vietnamese to English and vice versa</td><td>1 E-V text + 1 V-E text: 1. translating part 1 of each text; 2. full post-editing AI's translation for part 2 of each textLength of each text: 250 words + difficulty level.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The weights add up to <strong>100%</strong>. Minimum average to pass: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>How to read \"Completion criteria\":</em> it is the minimum score that one mark must reach (e.g. <code>&gt;0</code> = you must not get zero / must sit it; <code>4</code> = at least 4/10). Missing it can mean failing the subject even with a good average — this reading is the website's explanation, the table itself is the university's.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Tổng trọng số đúng <strong>100%</strong>. Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua môn: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>Cách đọc cột \"Điều kiện hoàn thành\":</em> là điểm tối thiểu đầu điểm đó phải đạt (vd <code>&gt;0</code> = không được 0 / phải dự; <code>4</code> = tối thiểu 4/10). Không đạt có thể trượt môn dù điểm trung bình cao — phần giải thích này là của web, bảng là của trường.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>The fine print per mark (verbatim)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Project 1 - Human-generated translation</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Test the acquainted knowledge and translation skills which student obtained during the courseContent based on topics of studied units<br><em>Grading guide:</em> Classwork, individually<br><em>Note:</em> rubric</li>\n<li><strong>Project 2 - AI-generated translation editing</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Test the acquainted knowledge and translation skills, using AI/ CAT tools critically, contextually and ethically(Students are required to evaluate and edit AI-generated translation)<br><em>Grading guide:</em> Homework, in groups of 3-4 students<br><em>Note:</em> rubric</li>\n<li><strong>Project 3 - Integrated project</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Human-in-the-loop editing, project management, cultural literacy, AI ethics<br><em>Grading guide:</em> Homework, in groups of 3-4 students<br><em>Note:</em> rubric</li>\n<li><strong>Translation</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Test the acquainted knowledge and translation skills students obtain in the delivered in the course</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Chi tiết từng đầu điểm (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Project 1 - Human-generated translation</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Test the acquainted knowledge and translation skills which student obtained during the courseContent based on topics of studied units<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> Classwork, individually<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> rubric</li>\n<li><strong>Project 2 - AI-generated translation editing</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Test the acquainted knowledge and translation skills, using AI/ CAT tools critically, contextually and ethically(Students are required to evaluate and edit AI-generated translation)<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> Homework, in groups of 3-4 students<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> rubric</li>\n<li><strong>Project 3 - Integrated project</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Human-in-the-loop editing, project management, cultural literacy, AI ethics<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> Homework, in groups of 3-4 students<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> rubric</li>\n<li><strong>Translation</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Test the acquainted knowledge and translation skills students obtain in the delivered in the course</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13471\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13471</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13471\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13471</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
