   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELT402 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 6 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13471 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ELT402 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>6 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13471 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>enhance student’s linguistic competence in translating administrative documents, and translate those documents with precision, accuracy and consistency.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>enhance student’s linguistic competence in translating buisness forms and financial documents , and and translate those documents with precision, accuracy and consistency.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>enhance student’s linguistic competence in translating technical documentation, and translate those documents with precision, accuracy and consistency.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>analyse and translate a complex using appropriate analytical methods and the ability to synthesise information in socio - cultural news and documents.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Exhibit professional working attitudes, effective communication, and teamwork skills through participation in project-based translation tasks that simulate authentic industry practices.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>ethically and critically use Gen-AI tools to enhance translation quality and facilitate translation processes</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13471\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13471</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13471\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13471</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
